      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds pretty biased lol. u say the government is just trying to keep power and that the implementation was botched, but u didnt explain how they plan to fix the shortfall they're worried about. can u actually explain the math/logic behind the reform? and is it even possible to fix it without making people angry?",
